<title>UK: Energy Group joins FT/S&amp;P index.</title>
<headline>Energy Group joins FT/S&amp;P index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The newly demerged Energy Group will be included within the calculation of the FT/S&amp;P Acturaries World Index from today, the index policy committee said on Monday.</p>
<p>Energy, demerged from Hanson Plc, made its debut on the FTSE 100 index today.</p>
<p>Hanson will remain a constituent of the FT/S&amp;P index but its classification changes to building materials from diversified holding companies.</p>
<p>Energy Group is classified under electric utilities, water works and supply. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
